  "description": "“There’s not a monster a slingshot can’t defeat” \n\nYuu’s father left him with a slingshot after saying that. With his proficiency with the slingshot, Kimura Yuu became “An F-rank with a 100% accuracy”, and has become active in fighting low-grade monsters. \n\nHowever, with his mana at “0.06” and the lowest rank, the teammates he raids with often ridicules him. One day, a command window which writes “Target point reached, exclusive store has been unlocked” “Skill: Flint Finger has been given as a reward”. \n\nWith his skills levelling up, he started defeating high-grade monsters one-by-one, even with his 0.06 mana… \n\nWill Yuu become the strongest Hunter with the slingshot his father left him?\n\n[from utoon]\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/66282540), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%A7%88%EB%A0%A5%EC%9D%B4-0.06%EC%9D%B8-%EB%82%B4%EA%B0%80-%EC%8A%A4%ED%82%AC%EB%A0%88%EB%B2%A8%EB%A7%8C%EC%9C%BC%EB%A1%9C-%EC%B5%9C%EA%B0%95-%ED%97%8C%ED%84%B0%EA%B0%80-%EB%90%98%EC%96%B4-%EC%83%88%EC%B4%9D%EC%9D%98-%EC%9C%84%EB%8C%80%ED%95%A8%EC%9D%84-%EC%A6%9D%EB%AA%85%ED%95%9C-%EA%B1%B4%EC%97%90-%EB%8C%80%ED%95%98%EC%97%AC/4425)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/174151)",
